v 3
d 'PLUMBVIEW': module to list variable values side by side across two pipeline stages
d
d plumbview merges two stages of a dataset on a case key and lists the
d FROM and TO values of selected variables side by side in long format
d (no variable-name length limits), with an optional changed-cells-only
d view and value-label text next to codes.
d
d KW: data management
d KW: data cleaning
d KW: audit
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Author: Brian W. Mandikiana, SESRI, Qatar University
d Support: email bwmandikiana@gmail.com
d Support: https://github.com/codeatcodecto/plumber/issues
d License: MIT
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261126
d
f plumbview.ado
